Add(Object)

      │
      ▼
GetHashCode()

      │
      ▼
hashCode % numberOfBuckets

      │
      ▼
Go to that bucket

      │
      ▼
Is bucket empty?
      │
 ┌────┴────┐
 │         │
Yes        No
 │         │
 ▼         ▼
Add    Compare using Equals()
              │
      ┌───────┴────────┐
      ▼                ▼
Equals == true   Equals == false
      │                │
 Don't Add        Add Object